  m_Name: Blade
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Turbine Blade
  description: The Turbine Blade is a critical component of the jet engine, responsible
    for extracting energy from the hot gases produced by the combustion process and
    converting it into mechanical energy to drive the engine's compressor and accessories.
    Its unique shape and material properties allow it to withstand extremely high
    temperatures and stresses. One interesting detail is that turbine blades are
    often coated with a thin layer of ceramic to provide additional thermal protection.
